### STM32G474 RCC Configuration for 170 MHz Operation (VDD = 3.6 V)

#### 1. Operating Conditions & Limits Analysis
* **Supply Voltage ($V_{DD}$)**: The board regulator outputs fixed $3.6\text{ V}$. According to Table 17 of the datasheet ([STM32G474_Datasheet p.84]), standard operating voltage is $1.71\text{ V} \le V_{DD} \le 3.6\text{ V}$. $3.6\text{ V}$ is right at the upper recommended operating limit and fully supported across all operational modes.
* **Maximum Frequency & Voltage Scaling**:
  - In normal Range 1 mode, $f_{\text{SYSCLK}} \le 150\text{ MHz}$.
